that you know, there's,

00:00:09.095 --> 00:00:10.857
they're playing the clip
and I'm genuinely going to,

00:00:10.857 --> 00:00:13.302
no, this new season is so good, which,

00:00:13.302 --> 00:00:14.381
I feel like I can say,

00:00:14.381 --> 00:00:15.989
cause I'm in the show this season,

00:00:15.989 --> 00:00:17.773
but, I'm not the lead, and William Jackson

00:00:17.773 --> 00:00:20.027
Harper from, he's Chidi on the good place.

00:00:20.027 --> 00:00:20.860
He's so amazing.

00:00:20.860 --> 00:00:21.693
