00:00:22.935 --> 00:00:24.741
And he is so good in it.

00:00:24.741 --> 00:00:26.527
And the new season is so good.

00:00:26.527 --> 00:00:27.906
And it's one of those things where,

00:00:27.906 --> 00:00:29.440
the first season, you know,

00:00:29.440 --> 00:00:30.670
I was the lead of the first season and

00:00:30.670 --> 00:00:32.808
it was, a lot of it was mined

00:00:32.808 --> 00:00:34.950
from my personal life--

00:00:34.950 --> 00:00:36.350
